{"claim_type": "observation", "confidence": "high", "key": "objective_reduced", "observed_at": "2026-09-11", "quote": "Because `J_i . w_i == TP_i`, this collapses exactly to adj_edge_jaccard = S_i (TP_i . m_i) / S_i w_i", "review_after": null, "status": "active", "tbl": "fact", "topic": "metric", "value": "The objective collapses exactly: adj_edge_jaccard = SUM_i (TP_i * m_i) / SUM_i w_i, where w_i = TP_i+FP_i+FN_i and m_i = max(0, 1 - 0.1*(N_i-E_i)/E_i). It is a micro-averaged Jaccard whose numerator is per-crop multiplier-weighted. division_jaccard is micro-pooled across crops."}
